    ("What is a Medi-Medi Plan?", "An exclusively aligned Dual Special Needs Plan: a Medicare Advantage plan run by the same organization as your Medi-Cal managed-care plan, so both programs are coordinated by one care team. Available in 41 counties for 2026 under CalAIM."),
    ("Where can I get free, unbiased Medicare counseling in California?", "HICAP, the Health Insurance Counseling and Advocacy Program, California&rsquo;s State Health Insurance Assistance Program, run by the Department of Aging through local Area Agencies on Aging: 1-800-434-0222. It is free and independent, and we point people to it."),
